  "contentHtml": "<p>첫차시 반 아이들에게 직접 측정을 시켜보았더니 너무 못해서... 그날은 실험 다 접고</p><p>사진으로 찍어서 띄워놓고 따라서 연결해보게 했습니다</p><p>똘똘한 반은 사진을 참고로 하여 직접 측정값 작성하고</p><p>저항의 연결에 따른 전류 전압관계 추리도 하고 자기들끼리 엄청 신기해하면서 알차게 끝났는데</p><p>어려워하는 반은 사진을 띄워 줘도 감을 전혀 못 잡더군요........... ㅠㅠ&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55bc31faa5ae393c63459c0aacf98f95ded3ef60\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/55bc31faa5ae393c63459c0aacf98f95ded3ef60\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"865\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74418a3ac41dc9056710e2c50a29b612c5202710\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/74418a3ac41dc9056710e2c50a29b612c5202710\" data-origin-width=\"1078\" data-origin-height=\"951\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39059cbee939c060b892aaef9a86ef28c2807b7d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/39059cbee939c060b892aaef9a86ef28c2807b7d\" data-origin-width=\"1079\" data-origin-height=\"923\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81616d1f02c6d306bbb3f25da10ec93735f4fec4\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/81616d1f02c6d306bbb3f25da10ec93735f4fec4\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"937\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d6f393d56203d4d1939f565ba212